00:06:37.542 --> 00:06:39.513
- He's brilliant, if I say so myself.

00:06:39.513 --> 00:06:41.243
- So both of our mamas were teachers.

00:06:41.243 --> 00:06:43.193
Were you a good student?

00:06:43.193 --> 00:06:45.890
